            <description><![CDATA[<style>body { font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 12px; }
h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 170)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Timecode now comes from the file.</b> A delivery that starts at 01:00:00:00 reads 01:00:00:00 — in the HUD, in burn-ins, and in exported movies.</li>
<li><b>Burn-ins no longer black out a strip of the frame</b> — each label sits on its own small plate, and the text follows the HUD Text size setting.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
